  "description": "Explore the haunting remnants of a world reshaped by fire and time. Scorched Lands is an atmospheric first-person exploration experience set across a vast, otherworldly desert landscape — where volcanic rock formations tower over ancient skeletal ruins, alien flora blooms defiantly from cracked earth, and the sky burns a permanent crimson.\nYou are a lone wanderer equipped with field instruments and a quiet curiosity. Seek out marked locations across a hostile yet breathtaking terrain — satellite dishes humming in the silence, solar arrays catching light on ridge lines, lava fields glowing just beyond the next canyon wall. Every destination tells a story. Every horizon promises something new.\n\nFeatures:\n\nStunning low-poly art direction that transforms desolation into beauty\nMultiple distinct biomes — scorched volcanic badlands, sun-bleached desert flats, and eerie overgrown ruins\nA meditative, pressure-free pace — no enemies, no timers, just exploration\nRich environmental storytelling hidden in the landscape itself\nPerfect for short sessions or long, unhurried wanderings",
